Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 05:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge compatible developer handoff fixes

Integrate verified hand and sword geometry, per-player equipment selection, bounded diagnostics and census hooks, and connection feedback. Apply smoothed regular-enemy transforms each native input frame with fresh actor-tree and session validation. Preserve coherent replay cohorts and collector-only pickup receipts. Matching client modules are distributed separately under the root client source.
